================================================================================
PLACEHOLDER FILE FOR BROADCOM STORCLI PACKAGE
================================================================================

This is a placeholder for the Broadcom StorCLI package that must be obtained
from Broadcom's website due to licensing requirements.

REQUIRED FILE:
  storcli_007.0327.0000.0000_all.deb

DOWNLOAD INSTRUCTIONS:
================================================================================

1. Visit the Broadcom Support Portal:
   https://www.broadcom.com/support/download-search

2. Search for "9400-8i" or "MegaRAID StorCLI"

3. Download the following file:
   - StorCLI (Unified tool for MegaRAID and Adaptec)
   - Version: 007.0327.0000.0000 or later
   - Package: storcli_007.0327.0000.0000_all.deb

4. Verify the package integrity (checksum will be provided on download page)

5. Place the downloaded file in this directory:
   ansible/files/storcli_007.0327.0000.0000_all.deb

6. Remove or rename this placeholder file

ALTERNATIVE DOWNLOAD (if above link doesn't work):
================================================================================

The StorCLI package may also be available through:
- Direct Broadcom customer portal (requires account)
- LSI/Broadcom documentation and tools downloads
- Proxmox community forums (user-shared links)

VERIFICATION:
================================================================================

After downloading, verify the package:

  $ dpkg -I storcli_007.0327.0000.0000_all.deb

Expected output should show:
  Package: storcli
  Version: 007.0327.0000.0000
  Architecture: all

NOTES:
================================================================================

- This package is required for HBA firmware management and monitoring
- The Broadcom 9400-8i HBA requires StorCLI for mixed mode configuration
- Mixed mode enables both SAS/SATA HDD and NVMe support
- Required cables: SFF-8643 to SFF-8639 (MPN 05-50065-00 or 05-50064-00)

REFERENCE DOCUMENTATION:
================================================================================

Broadcom 9400-8i Documentation:
  https://docs.broadcom.com/doc/12354774

StorCLI User Guide:
  https://docs.broadcom.com/docs/storcli-user-guide

TROUBLESHOOTING:
================================================================================

If you cannot find the package:
1. Ensure you have a Broadcom support account (free registration)
2. Search for "MegaRAID StorCLI" instead of specific model numbers
3. Check Proxmox forums for community-provided links
4. Contact Broadcom support for direct download assistance

================================================================================
